- **Instant Webhook Redirection:** Modified `/payment-success` (PaymentSuccess.jsx) to automatically poll the Limitless backend up to 10 times. Once `payment_status === "paid"` is confirmed, it automatically redirects the user to the dashboard.
- **Pricing Page Routing Updates:** Modified "Upgrade to Premium" CTA to check `isLoggedIn` and route directly to `/payment` instead of the registration modal.
- **Vigil Payment API Integration:** Completed Vigil payment API integration (LIVE mode active on Stripe), fetching pricing plans and configuring tiered subscriptions via frontend.

